The ring toss game earned the same amount each day.
Total earnings over {days} days = {total_earnings}
So the daily earnings {daily_earnings} = {total_earnings} / {days}
The answer is {daily_earnings}

## Actual analysis and solution process

In this question, {total_earnings} = 165 and {days} = 5.
